  "reported_status": "Source-reported mathematical arguments only. Intake checked byte preservation and repository structure; no independent proof reconstruction, scientific-code replay, citation verification, formal proof, quantum circuit execution, or experimental validation was performed. External correctness and historical priority remain UNKNOWN. Producer reports 2,502 finite numerical assertions: 690 multiprecision and 1,812 floating-point, including a ten-qubit dyadic fixture. These are not exact arithmetic, formal proof, independent reproduction or laboratory evidence. Code syntax parsed only at intake.",
  "scientific_scope_status": "For K=N=sum_x n_x, input psi=|+>_a|0>_elsewhere and one-qubit output, define E_T(H)=sup_{0<=t<=T} D(rho_H^a(t),rho_K^a(t)). A tolerant test accepts every E_T<=eta and rejects every E_T>=3/4 with probability >=2/3. A fresh sample supplies vacuum outside accessible ports S. Arbitrarily strong controls, ancillas, memory, measurements, resets and feedback are allowed only on S during total native time <=tau per sample. Splitting a coherent run does not reset this cap. Full-system terminal output and collective inter-run processing are granted; all discarded/postselected attempts count. No bath reinsertion, remote preparation or inverse unknown evolution is supplied. The Hamiltonian is fixed and memoryless across samples.",
